@startuml
title Sequence - UC-09 Placement Test [PROPOSED / NOT IMPLEMENTED]
skinparam shadowing false
actor Learner
participant "Learner Web" as Web
participant "Placement Service/Action\n[PROPOSED]" as Placement
database "Published Exercises/Courses" as DB

Learner -> Web: Start placement test
Web -> Placement: Request versioned test
Placement -> DB: Load approved questions
DB --> Placement: Ordered exercise payloads
Placement --> Web: Test definition
loop each question
  Learner -> Web: Submit answer
  Web -> Placement: Validated answer
end
Placement -> Placement: Score + CEFR mapping + tie-break
Placement -> DB: Find published Course by CEFR
DB --> Placement: Recommended course or none
alt sufficient result
  Placement --> Web: Level + recommendation
else insufficient/error
  Placement --> Web: Default course / skip path
end
Web --> Learner: Show outcome
note over Placement,DB
  API, persistence and RLS are not locked.
  Separate implementation approval required.
end note
@enduml
